flowchart TD
    A[Authenticated account, service or scoped-link session] --> B[Resolve explicit organization and trusted principal]
    B --> C{Active membership or approved special path?}
    C -->|No| X[Deny safely and audit when significant]
    C -->|Yes| D[Resolve current authority version]
    D --> E{Capability covers exact action?}
    E -->|No| X
    E -->|Yes| F{Scope covers branch, operation, queue or resource?}
    F -->|No| X
    F -->|Yes| G{Resource state, purpose, fields and approval permit it?}
    G -->|No| X
    G -->|Yes| H[Open transaction and establish local tenant context]
    H --> I[Application command plus composite tenant keys and RLS]
    I --> J[Commit state, evidence and outbox]
    J --> K[Propagate verified tenant to cache, search, objects, queues and sync]

    L[Ubi workforce] --> M[Case + step-up + scoped JIT grant]
    M --> G
